# Architecture

- **Monorepo**: pnpm workspaces + turbo
- **Packages**: `@receiptbrain/web` (Next.js + API), `@receiptbrain/worker` (BullMQ process), `@receiptbrain/ui`, `@receiptbrain/lib`, `@receiptbrain/contracts` (shared Zod schemas)
- **Services**: `services/ai` (Python FastAPI)
- **Fixtures**: `fixtures/receipts/` — sample images + ground-truth JSON for AI tests
- **Web**: Next.js App Router; route handlers for API; React Query + Zustand + RHF + Zod
- **Worker**: separate Node process (`apps/worker`) — BullMQ handlers cannot live in Next.js route handlers
- **AI**: FastAPI; `/extract`, `/recommend`; OpenAI Vision via **Structured Outputs**; internal-only (`X-Internal-Token`); never block long work on HTTP
- **Data**: PostgreSQL via Prisma (Decimal for money, indexes on FK + common queries); Redis + BullMQ for `extract_receipt` and `generate_insights`
- **Storage**: S3-compatible (MinIO local), **private bucket + signed URLs only**; receipt images separate from structured data
- **Auth**: NextAuth.js v5 + Resend magic link — MVP, not bonus; every API route except `/api/health` requires session

## Domain models (Prisma)

User → Receipt (status, fieldConfidence, imageHash) → Item; Receipt → ExtractionAttempt; Merchant; User → Subscription (status, confidence, sourceReceiptIds); User → Insight (status, sourceReceiptIds, sourceSubscriptionId)

## Enums

`ReceiptStatus`, `ItemCategory`, `SubscriptionInterval`, `SubscriptionStatus`, `InsightType`, `InsightStatus`, `ExtractionStatus`

## Insight types

`cheaper_alternative`, `subscription_waste`, `spending_spike`, `optimization_tip`

## Env vars (see `.env.example`)

`DATABASE_URL`, `REDIS_URL`, `S3_*`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `OPENAI_MODEL_EXTRACT`, `OPENAI_MODEL_RECOMMEND`, `AI_SERVICE_URL`, `AI_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `NEXTAUTH_SECRET`, `RESEND_API_KEY`, `SENTRY_DSN`, `MAX_UPLOAD_MB`

## Do not

- Move workers into Next.js route handlers
- Use `Float` for money — use Prisma `Decimal`
- Expose S3 URLs publicly — always sign and stream
- Skip session check on a new API route
- Call AI service from the web (only the worker does)
